<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin 39-wk T-bill yield rises to 9.99 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin 39-wk T-bill yield rises to 9.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at an auction of Slovak Finance Ministry 39-week treasury bills hit 9.986 percent, up from 9.669 percent in the last auction of similar bills, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The NBS said of the 1.089 billion crowns in bids at the auction, it accepted only 209 million crowns worth. The amount of bills on offer was unspecified.</p>
